# Handoff 2026-11-23 — full-page mode editor integration starting

## Locked design

Worktree `feature-mode-editor-design`, branch based on `main` at `7639891`.
Origin docs: `docs/features/mode-editor-design/{GRILL,PRD-TRD,IMPL}`.
Reviewed prototype: `wireframe/mode-studio/editor/`.

Decisions: fixed `/modes/editor` route with `?id=`/`?new=1`/`?tab=` behind
Suspense; raw JSON is a read-only mirror, tree is the editor; skillInstructions
is a link into the Markdown tab; unsaved AI drafts and return notices travel via
guarded sessionStorage; old modal editor is retired; one save path through
`modeSaveRequest`; theme uses app CSS variables.

## Ordered remaining steps and proof

1. Pure helpers + `mode-editor-utils.test.ts` (RED then GREEN).
2. `JsonTree.tsx` + `MarkdownPreview.tsx` thin renderers; typecheck/eslint.
3. Route + `ModeEditorPage` + sessionStorage helpers + ModesClient handoff +
   PWA lists + CSS; retire `ModeEditor.tsx`; build with check-pwa green.
4. Post-sim, fresh-eyes review, reconciliation, full gates, one commit per phase.
5. Human gate: open review event, then wait for Victor before merge.

